}_{32}=2$ and ${u}_{33}=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n{l}_{32}\\cdot {u}_{33}=2\\cdot 1=2.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186489311 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186489364 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489311 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3c7eef7d-ace3-5a6c-9ca4-acfa0630da78" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489311 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186241086 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489331 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186489382 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489331 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "79c8766e-ce43-5592-a5f0-e1433e944d4c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489331 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186489250 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489342 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186489311 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489342 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "95d492f3-6c4d-596b-b0d8-b7cf3e956801" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489342 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186241084 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489364 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186489331 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489364 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d47739bb-4de9-5041-82d0-ade4cc2cd2b1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489364 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186489243 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489382 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "fa750b8a-5567-556e-812e-8c8f5c7c8f4e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489382 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186489232 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186557872 #edb/ref 1080 "6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186557872 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186557872 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0211b914-a3ae-5d39-96e7-5b2cb42a8917" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186557876 #edb/ref 1080 "5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186557876 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186557876 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "033ae31a-ff94-5015-b529-58a259bb2d45" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186557880 #edb/ref 1080 "-2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186557880 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186557880 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "056f1d44-7ab1-528a-b2c5-7987